<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Borden Chemicals raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Borden Chemicals raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said it raised its rating on Borden Chemicals &amp; Plastics LP to &quot;outperform significantly&quot; from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for further details.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/4 to 10-3/4.</p>
</text>
